; Tutorial_4_Make_a_PDF_Readable.inix -- make a pdf readable

[about]
Title=4 - Make a PDF Readable
Intro=Converting a PDF into a web page whose text can be read, searched and copied, and what to expect from a scanned one.
Setup=A PDF of your own, such as a statement or a manual.
Homework=Convert a PDF, then search the web page for one word with Control+F.

[step]

Say=One want: a PDF manual whose text I can read line by line and search, instead of a viewer that reads it in pieces.
Key=

[step]

Say=I open the dialog and type the PDF's path in Source files. Typing works as well as browsing.
Key=Alt+Control+2
Hear=2htm dialog
Hear=Source files edit
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=Enter converts. No other program is needed for a PDF; 2htm reads it itself.
Key=Enter
Hear=Converting Manual dot pdf
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=The result box confirms it.
Key=
Hear=1 file converted
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=I open the new page in the browser. The text arrives as paragraphs, in reading order.
Key=
Hear=Manual, heading level 1
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=A PDF does not always mark its headings the way a Word document does, so a page may have fewer headings; paragraphs and lines are still there to read.
Key=

[step]

Say=Control plus F, the browser's find, searches the whole manual at once.
Key=Control+F
Hear=Find on page, edit
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=I type warranty and press Enter. The browser lands on the first match.
Key=Enter
Hear=warranty, 1 of 3
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=Escape closes the find box, and the reading cursor is at that place.
Key=Escape
Hear=The warranty covers parts and labor for two years.
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=Text can be selected and copied as on any web page, which a PDF viewer often makes hard: Shift with Down Arrow selects, Control plus C copies.
Key=Shift+Down Arrow
Hear=The warranty covers parts and labor for two years. selected
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=A planned misstep: a scanned PDF, which is a picture of each page with no text inside it.
Key=
Hear=Converting Scan dot pdf
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=The page that results is nearly empty, because there was no text to take.
Key=
Hear=Scan, heading level 1
Hear=blank
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=A scanned page needs text recognition first. HomerScribe and other tools read such pages; then 2htm can convert the text they find.
Key=

[step]

Say=A quick test tells the two apart: if the browser's find cannot find a word you can see in the PDF, the PDF is a scan.
Key=

[step]

Say=A long PDF becomes one long page. Control plus End jumps to its end, and Control plus Home back to the top.
Key=Control+End
Hear=End of page
Note=Confirm the wording with a live run: buildTutorials -live.

[step]

Say=The browser remembers your place while the page stays open, so a manual can be read in sittings.
Key=

[step]

Say=To keep one section, select it from its heading to the next, and paste it into a document of its own.
Key=

[step]

Say=Page numbers printed in the PDF arrive as ordinary lines of text, so the page of a passage can still be found when someone asks for it.
Key=

[step]

Say=Tables in a PDF are drawn rather than described, so they may arrive as lines of text rather than a table; the words are all there.
Key=

[step]

Say=When a PDF must stay a PDF, the converted page is still a quick way to read and search it first.
Key=

[step]

Say=For a PDF with text, one Enter makes it readable and searchable. The next walk makes plain text to listen to.
Key=
